# VHS Tape: Jobs Triage Screen
Output artifacts/tui_jobs.png
Output artifacts/tui_jobs.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 750
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"

Type "python3 scripts/dashboard.py"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "2"
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot artifacts/tui_jobs.png
Sleep 2s
